{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06215","headline":"游感化寺昙兴上人山院 · 裴迪","name":"游感化寺昙兴上人山院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不远灞陵边，安居向十年。\n入门穿竹径，留客听山泉。\n鸟啭深林里，心闲落照前。\n浮名竟何益，从此愿栖禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴迪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}